# Feature — Smoke Tracker

## Overview
A daily cigarette consumption tracker integrated into Saku.
Users can log each cigarette with timestamp, set a daily limit,
view statistics, and automatically record cigarette spending as
an expense transaction in the main finance tracker.

**This feature is OPTIONAL and OFF by default.**
Since Saku is a general-purpose app, Smoke Tracker must be
explicitly enabled by the user. When disabled, all smoke-related
UI elements are completely hidden from the app — no menu entries,
no home card, no routes accessible.

Feature toggle is stored in the global app settings (Hive 'settings' box).
Key: `smokeTrackerEnabled` (bool, default: false)

