## Design Rules
- All monochrome — no colors
- Counter number: very large bold font (72px) — the hero element
- Progress bar:
  - Under 80%: black fill, gray track
  - 80–99%: dark gray (#3A3A3A) fill
  - 100%+: full black, "Over limit" label appears
- Log button: large circular black button with 🚬 icon
- Timeline rows: clean, minimal — time on left, delete icon on right
- Charts: black bars only, dashed gray line for daily limit
- Notification style: dark snackbar (black bg, white text)

